{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Grafluent provides graph representations as copy-on-write value types, graph classes that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enforce their invariants, and generic algorithms that specialize for the concrete graph and weight"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"types they run on. Vertices can be any "},{"code":"Hashable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" type. Lookups trap on a missing vertex, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"their "},{"code":"checked:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" spellings throw a typed "},{"code":"VertexNotFound","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" instead."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import Grafluent"},{"type":"text","text":" imports every module. Each module also has its own documentation and can be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"imported on its own."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import Grafluent","","let steps = [\"fetch\", \"compile\", \"test\", \"package\"]","var build = AdjacencyList<String> {","    for (step, next) in zip(steps, steps.dropFirst()) {","        DirectedEdge(from: step, to: next)","    }","    DirectedEdge(from: \"compile\", to: \"package\")","}","build.insert(edge: DirectedEdge(from: \"package\", to: \"publish\"))","","let next = Array(build.successors(of: \"compile\"))  \/\/ [\"test\", \"package\"]","let order = build.topologicalSort()                \/\/ [\"fetch\", \"compile\", \"test\", \"package\", \"publish\"]"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Modules","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Modules"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Vocabulary:"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"